.TH SM 1 "November 2026" "service-maestro-cli" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
sm \- command-line client for Service Maestro
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B sm
[\fIGLOBAL OPTIONS\fR]
\fICOMMAND\fR
[\fIARGUMENTS\fR]
.sp
.B sm control
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B sm
logs in to a Service Maestro server, stores an \fBsm_session\fR cookie, and controls
the live output through the authenticated HTTP API. It also exposes a generic
\fBapi\fR command and an interactive keyboard transport.
.SH GLOBAL OPTIONS
.TP
.BI \-\-url " URL"
Server base URL. Defaults to \fBhttps://localhost:8080\fR, then the saved value, then
the \fBSM_URL\fR environment variable.
.TP
.B \-\-insecure
Skip TLS certificate verification, for the locally generated self-signed certificate.
.TP
.B \-\-secure
Force TLS certificate verification.
.TP
.BI \-\-cookie " COOKIE"
Session cookie value or a full \fBsm_session=...\fR header.
.TP
.BI \-\-username " USER"
Username for login or automatic re-login.
.TP
.BI \-\-password " PASSWORD"
Password. Prefer \fBSM_PASSWORD\fR or the interactive prompt.
.TP
.BI \-\-config " FILE"
Alternate config file. Defaults to \fB~/.config/service-maestro/cli.json\fR.
.TP
.BI \-\-timeout " SECONDS"
HTTP timeout.
.TP
.B \-\-json
Print the raw live state as JSON.
.TP
.B \-\-quiet
Suppress command result output.
.SH COMMANDS
.TP
.B login
Prompt for a password, log in and save the session cookie. Supports
\fB\-\-username\fR, \fB\-\-password\fR and \fB\-\-no-save\fR.
.TP
.B logout
Call the logout endpoint and remove the saved cookie.
.TP
.B status
Show the current live session, set list, item, page, blank state and controls.
.TP
.B control
Run the interactive keyboard transport. Press \fB?\fR for the shortcut list and
\fBq\fR to quit.
.TP
.BI "api " METHOD " " PATH " [" BODY ]
Call any API endpoint. BODY is JSON, \fB@file\fR or \fB-\fR for stdin.
.TP
.B setlists [SEARCH]
List set lists and their IDs.
.TP
.B songs [SEARCH]
List songs.
.TP
.BI "start " SETLIST
Start a live session. Accepts an exact ID or a unique name/date match.
.TP
.BI "apply " SETLIST
Apply a set list to the current live session. Use \fB\-\-now\fR to replace immediately.
.TP
.B stop
Stop the live session.
.TP
.B next
Advance one page, or into the next item at a boundary.
.TP
.B prev
Go back one page, or into the previous item at a boundary.
.TP
.BI "page " DELTA
Move by a page delta.
.TP
.BI "goto-page " INDEX
Jump to a zero-based page index.
.TP
.BI "goto-item " INDEX
Jump to a zero-based live queue item.
.TP
.B blank [on|off|toggle]
Toggle or set output blanking.
.TP
.B show
Unblank the output.
.TP
.BI "transpose " DELTA
Transpose the current song by semitones.
.TP
.BI "lines " COUNT
Set lines per page.
.TP
.B footer [TEXT]
Set the footer; omit the text or use \fB\-\-clear\fR to clear it.
.TP
.B bible-verses [on|off|toggle]
Show or hide Bible verse numbers.
.TP
.B quick-text [TEXT]
Show transient quick text. Omit the text or use \fB-\fR to read stdin.
.TP
.B autoplay [on|off|toggle]
Temporarily override autoplay. Supports \fB\-\-mode\fR, \fB\-\-delay\fR and \fB\-\-reset\fR.
.TP
.B items
List the live queue.
.SH INTERACTIVE SHORTCUTS
.TP
.B n, Space, Enter, Right
Next page.
.TP
.B p, Backspace, Left
Previous page.
.TP
.B j, Down / k, Up
Next or previous live item.
.TP
.B b
Toggle blank.
.TP
.B s
Show/unblank.
.TP
.B [ / ]
Transpose down or up one semitone.
.TP
.B - / +
Fewer or more lines per page.
.TP
.B v
Toggle Bible verse numbers.
.TP
.B a / A
Toggle autoplay or reset the temporary autoplay override.
.TP
.B f / x
Prompt for footer text or quick text.
.TP
.B g / i
Prompt for a one-based page or item number.
.TP
.B r
Refresh.
.TP
.B ?
Show or hide shortcut help.
.TP
.B q
Quit and restore the terminal.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I ~/.config/service-maestro/cli.json
Saved URL, TLS preference, username and session cookie. Written with mode 0600.
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.TP
.B SM_URL
Server base URL.
.TP
.B SM_COOKIE
Session cookie value or full cookie header.
.TP
.B SM_USERNAME
Username for login or automatic re-login.
.TP
.B SM_PASSWORD
Password for automatic login. Avoid putting this in shell history.
.TP
.B SM_INSECURE
Set to 1 to skip TLS certificate verification.
.TP
.B SM_CLI_CONFIG
Alternate config file path.
.SH EXAMPLES
.nf
sm --insecure login --username operator
sm setlists
sm start "Sunday morning"
sm next
sm blank
sm control
sm api GET /api/live
.fi
.SH SECURITY
The saved session cookie is equivalent to a logged-in browser session. Keep the
config file private. Prefer \fBSM_PASSWORD\fR or the interactive prompt over
\fB\-\-password\fR. Only use \fB\-\-insecure\fR with a trusted local development server.
.SH SEE ALSO
Documentation under \fI/usr/share/doc/service-maestro-cli/\fR.
